WEBVTT

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:09.840
The following program is intended for mature audiences
and contains Adult Content, Graphic Language,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.760
Graphic Violence, Brief Nudity and
Strong Sexual Content including rape.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.560
We're counting on you from tomorrow.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:19.970
Leave it all to me.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.980
You can trust in your junior.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:24.690
It might not seem like it, but we're still--

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.610
Nobody move!

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.030
Answer the following questions
in a normal, level voice.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:32.780
Got it?

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.660
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.080
One two three

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.380
Undead tree

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.800
What truth

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.470
I'll come true

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:01.640
Wow...

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:05.520
I see that bright light

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:11.900
This is all I have

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:16.410
What did you say?
I know

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:20.950
Why do you say?

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:26.620
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:33.340
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:37.680
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:41.430
Survive of vision

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:44.730
Unfinished heaven

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:48.480
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:52.230
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:57.030
Survive of vision

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.060
What are you doing?!

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:28.560
Identify yourself!

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.520
Back away from my sanctuary, vermin!

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.030
Stop. Hey!

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:37.950
You can't just-- Hey!

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:47.370
That man is a devil.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.540
But in his body lies value.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:55.090
In my hands, even devilish scum like him
can live to serve the future--

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.390
The future, huh?

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:08.140
How dare you subject the men of Edo to this?!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:11.190
The only devil here is you!

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.490
What a terrifying woman.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:39.970
If you were awake, then say so.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:44.300
I couldn't really tell at first.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:49.430
I was thinking, "She looks like her,
but did she always look that mature?"

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:55.940
They say a girl can change
within three days of not seeing her.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.980
I've never heard anything like that.

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:03.410
How's your body. Is it all right?

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.160
I wouldn't say it's all right.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:09.370
Did you come here on your own?

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.750
What? No...

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.920
We just got separated.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.040
"We"?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.630
She's just like me.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.090
A girl who's had someone important taken from her.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:22.340
So two girls? Not to mention you came here unarmed.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.680
We made lots of preparations...

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.220
But there were some unforeseen circumstances...

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.430
Listen...

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.770
You really should have considered
how we were going to escape--

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:35.770
It's not like I knew what was happening in here!

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:38.400
But I know we'll be okay.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:42.110
If you and I are together, we have nothing to fear.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.740
Thanks for the wake-up call.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.460
Stop! Won't you all stop?!

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.380
Stupid! You won't stop them by shouting, get physical!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.720
Should we have really given up the keys?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.640
It's caused quite a ruckus.

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.930
I've been skeptical the whole time.

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.180
All we've made are mountains of corpses.

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.390
It's all right.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:18.940
It's not medicine,
but we'll save many more lives this way.

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:22.280
-Now, we should be off too.
-What?

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.900
-But we have to be at the meeting--
-That's flown off the table.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:29.240
They'll know who did this after just a little investigation.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.540
-If we're found out, it'll go quick...
-What?

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:32.910
What do you mean?!

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.580
Hey! Mister Toraemon!

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:40.750
Here goes.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.630
Yeah. Get it over with.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.850
-How is it?
-A little longer.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.230
Really though, good job finding me.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:04.400
It was very rough going,

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:08.070
-before, and after entering Fukiage.
-Fukiage?!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.910
Does that mean we're under Edo castle right now?

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:12.790
What? You didn't know?

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:16.410
Yeah. Well, knowing that will make this easier.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.580
We need to hurry with the other arm and...

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.420
So you've come.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.220
Get behind me.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:34.810
It's unfitting for a sword to be rusted
by a woman's blood...

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.310
But I must nip this in the bud.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:42.020
I have a plan.

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:44.730
-If he's vulnerable for even one moment--
-Got it.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.400
-Hey!
-Take this,

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:48.780
Kagimura Habaki!

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.120
Perform, Winged Wills of the Wisp!

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.330
It worked!

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:00.790
Very tricky.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:01.960
Habaki!

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:09.420
Where did you get that?

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.340
It's a parting gift from Dewanosuke.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.680
It gave me quite a shock

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:18.060
seeing him return to the cell
and pull that thing out of his leg.

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:22.190
Perhaps it was a souvenir for his wife.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:26.440
It matters not.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:30.070
One eye is all I need to cut down a man

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.160
whose arm is bound.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.870
-Mr. Manji!
-Don't move!

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.750
-But--
-It's fine, just watch.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:46.170
What?! What have you done?!

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.460
The place that I hid the needle

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.970
became saturated with the anesthetics

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:53.720
that were constantly being fed

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.810
through my mouth and nose.

00:07:58.100 --> 00:07:59.730
Manji...

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.690
-There!
-Lord Habaki!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.150
How dare you?!

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:12.490
It's one thing after another down here.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:25.330
Behold, Benki has cleared a path for you!

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:27.500
You may now enter, sir.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:28.800
Sir?

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.720
A momentous occasion.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.350
So here you are.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:40.100
You two, carry Habaki out of here.

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:41.930
I will handle this.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:42.980
Yes sir!

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:45.520
Sir, when did you get in here?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:46.980
Who are you?!

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:48.480
What?

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.160
You!

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:06.170
What?

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:09.960
What was that?

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:13.550
Doa?

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.300
-How?
-Here.

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:16.930
I took this back.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.180
Thank you.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.560
More importantly, what's going on?!

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:21.930
Mr. Isaku is...

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.310
I'm not sure.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.520
I couldn't just leave him in pieces.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.400
And when I gathered him up he stuck.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.940
-In other words, this means he was alive?
-Yup!

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:33.610
I'm sure I cut him.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.740
You did that to Isaku?

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.740
Who else could have cleaved that giant in half

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:45.040
with one stroke, if not I, Asaemon?

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.010
Are you one of those...

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:00.800
It couldn't be,

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.890
are you in league with the Itto-ryu?

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:03.970
That's right.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.770
ITTO-RYU
EXECUTE

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:08.850
Execute.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.860
An iron plate hat insert?

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.070
Hear me, iron cutter.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:31.670
-Doa!
-You...

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:35.710
seem unfamiliar with an opponent who can cut iron.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.010
Doa!

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:43.600
Not half bad, if I do say so.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.370
Hey, Asa!

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:11.500
I finally got to plant one on you.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.420
Mr. Manji!

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:17.010
Doa. Go to Mr. Isaku.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.760
Manji...

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:22.720
Your guts

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:25.010
will surely make a fine medicine.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:26.470
Come take them then.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:35.860
Isaku!

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.470
Sir!

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:13.770
Withdraw! Withdraw!

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:27.950
There was no need to kill him...

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.540
You don't get to spout that nonsense!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.420
This whole ghastly state of affairs was your doing!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:40.840
Normally, I'd say killing you 100 times over
would still fall short,

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:44.180
but if Dewanosuke were alive and here right now,

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.180
he'd say, "Don't kill him."

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.890
May the dead haunt you for a lifetime.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:57.020
Now, we should be going--

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:58.480
Wait, I've got this.

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:01.820
That chain...

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.900
I can break it for you.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:05.030
Mr. Isaku!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.950
Some astounding friends you've made.

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:11.790
Well, then I'll trouble you to remove it.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:18.340
Doa!

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.300
Doa!

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:22.920
What are you doing? Hurry and go save her!

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:23.970
Right!

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.180
What do we do, Mr. Manji? We're out of options!

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:28.680
Keep your composure.

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:29.680
This is no problem.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:31.470
We'll just sever this one too.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.100
-Get on the table.
-What?

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.560
You've got your sword now, it won't take as long.

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:42.400
There's just no helping it.
I'll carry the hand as we escape.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:45.860
Mr. Manji?

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:51.950
How?

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.540
Lying with held breath and erased presence,

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.250
in wait for the perfect chance

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.250
is the way of the opportunist.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.970
Though at my age, 30 minutes is the limit.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:17.020
Manji...

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.690
With your insides,

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.980
I think this will heal.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.320
No.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.780
It'd be like poison to you.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.070
Next, the right.

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:38.330
-Rin! Crank the chain!
-Okay!

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.140
Iron... Cutter...

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:05.820
Well, no need to overstay.

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.780
Let's collect my limbs and...

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:10.030
Oh, come on...

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.290
Hang in there,

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:24.630
Mr. Manji!

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:26.840
Rin.

00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.010
Grab my arm.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:01.870
Why?

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:04.920
Renzo!

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.090
Come on back.

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.550
Now I'll let you off with just some beatings.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.560
It's...

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:34.780
Wait. Don't Renzo! That person is...

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.320
That man...

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.430
Someone! Help!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.030
Hold tight, Jiro!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:21.950
Brother!

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:26.290
They still haven't dispersed?

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.250
Very well, nock arrows!

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.210
We'll send a message they won't forget.

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:32.510
Please wait, Master Murauchi.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:33.470
What's this? Move!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.760
If you consider the situation,

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.510
simply making examples of them

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.300
will only agitate them further.

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.180
-I think--
-Know your place!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:44.270
Someone call the rifleman.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.350
Kono, Terashima, and Soma

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.440
-will take up bows--
-Sorry.

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:51.110
Master Shimoda!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:55.200
This uproar can be quelled without seeing blood.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:57.280
That is what I believe.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.280
Open the Kajibashi gate!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.830
If it goes awry, I will take my own life!

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:05.080
Open the gates! Open the gates!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.960
Darling!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.550
Daddy!

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.230
You three.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.390
Yes?

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:29.060
What is it?

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.770
We received a message a while ago

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.820
that the ones responsible for this mess

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.030
all bore the appearance of doctors.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:39.860
I'd like to ask some questions over there.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:41.620
Hey, hold it, hold it!

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.290
No no, these aren't the guys.

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.330
How can you be sure without investigating?

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:49.210
Well, I was only just informed,

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:52.090
but three doctors were captured
at the Sukiyabashi gate.

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:55.510
A note from the elders confirmed it.

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:58.050
What's this? I've heard nothing of it.

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:01.300
Like I said, I only just heard it myself.

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:04.930
What, so these three are just regular prisoners?

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:07.390
Your looks are deceiving. Begone now!

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:08.600
Yes!

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:09.520
Thank you.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:14.020
Mr. Karukozawa!

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:21.570
An old acquaintance of mine...

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.870
disregarded mine and our master's advice,
crossed the ocean,

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.700
and set his sights on Western medicine.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.330
I tried to show him his folly at the time.

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:36.340
Though, I've no mind to rebuke you anymore.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:41.090
Because no matter what or where
in the world he and I study,

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.050
as long as our aim is the same,

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.810
our paths will merge in the end.

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:49.770
Much like the scene below us right now.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.730
People are grateful for good health.

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:55.360
The people revel in the good health of others.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:57.730
A heart that aims for scenes like this,

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:01.780
should find no disagreement
between Western or Chinese medicine.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.280
I believe

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.620
that even now he is walking

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:07.700
upon that path.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:18.760
Hold on a second.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:21.760
I'll go get something for you to wear.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:25.890
Rin...

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:32.440
She'll be okay, right?

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:39.320
You're pretty nosy yourself.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:40.860
You're right.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:48.370
How do you feel right now?

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:51.870
Let's see, right now...

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.830
I feel sublimely...

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.960
hungry.

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:57.960
Oh, Mr. Manji...

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:00.920
That really is all you ever talk about.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:04.550
But I do feel the same.

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:11.120
What we can bestow...

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:12.950
is not immortality,

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:14.250
but fate.

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:22.300
And that's just fine.

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:25.380
That is plenty.

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:31.470
I see.

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:33.390
So you really did leave.

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:36.310
I couldn't agree more in that decision, but...

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:38.770
Rin, take this.

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:41.270
And this is...?

00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:44.110
When the girls in my hometown come of age,

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:47.360
they carve pretty patterns on short swords

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:49.450
and give them to the man they love.

00:22:50.280 --> 00:22:52.620
I received two from my mother long ago,

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:54.790
so I'll give you one in place of rent.

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.250
The man you love...?

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:59.420
I'm worried about you, Rin.

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:02.710
17 is creeping up on unmarriageable, you know?

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:04.960
I don't want sympathy from a kid!

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:09.340
But this one's carved a bit.

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:11.470
I carved the very beginning of it.

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:13.550
You can continue it like that if you want.

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:16.520
This pattern...

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:19.390
Unukara Kan'nasui.

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:22.190
It means "Even if we part, we will meet again."

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:24.400
It's a symbol I thought up.

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:31.860
ACT SEVENTEEN - CEREMONIAL BOND
